  "sentences": {
    "s01": {
      "id": "s01",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s01.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s01.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 9.923,
      "files": {
        "v3-s01.opus": "6ed896f50f095b0dae0010ed650b01b218ac4ef1ec1a0e841299d7fc29baf779",
        "v3-s01.mp3": "1fb0a9b427d54abfb1e28bdd47b2a28b324e64ef2e67d02904e9fa701ccbf3b4"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s01-01",
          "text": "One difficulty is that almost all of what is called behavioral science ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.97
        },
        {
          "id": "s01-02",
          "text": "continues to trace behavior to states of mind, feelings, traits of character, human nature, and so on.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 3.97,
          "end": 9.923
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "02",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "02",
        "02"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s02": {
      "id": "s02",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s02.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s02.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 10.243,
      "files": {
        "v3-s02.opus": "8882015277d159a471ea95d5f2c00611dbca5a99219d4a8dbf11d5800f50dc62",
        "v3-s02.mp3": "43ec01ce2195e783c40fb3eab82bedada292542fcae946a02c43703a9338517f"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s02-01",
          "text": "The behavioral sciences have been slow to change ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.609
        },
        {
          "id": "s02-02",
          "text": "partly because the explanatory items often seem to be directly observed ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 2.609,
          "end": 6.871
        },
        {
          "id": "s02-03",
          "text": "and partly because other kinds of explanations have been hard to find.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 6.871,
          "end": 10.243
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "02",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "02",
        "02",
        "02"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s03": {
      "id": "s03",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s03.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s03.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 13.422,
      "files": {
        "v3-s03.opus": "90c74519a0f8da0e3d3b7ad852ff10c6708d7f8f7a8f26bb6967d95972e45099",
        "v3-s03.mp3": "b937d7eda477b4e0f0f591916b4b7974f9ac866f64a71dd20eb820ca7449f662"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s03-01",
          "text": "The role of natural selection in evolution was formulated only a little more than a hundred years ago, ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.363
        },
        {
          "id": "s03-02",
          "text": "and the selective role of the environment in shaping and maintaining the behavior of the individual ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 5.363,
          "end": 10.725
        },
        {
          "id": "s03-03",
          "text": "is only beginning to be recognized and studied.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 10.725,
          "end": 13.422
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "02",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "02",
        "02",
        "02"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s04": {
      "id": "s04",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s04.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s04.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 11.931,
      "files": {
        "v3-s04.opus": "041e4d4a344abbf21228531117ed342eb7c085297dadcc91b18003ae260cc3e9",
        "v3-s04.mp3": "0956eac4aeff7970f5c333fa5ff76726bec8403715830d35c6ac9edc882793fa"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s04-01",
          "text": "They are the possessions of the autonomous (self-governing) man of traditional theory, ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.675
        },
        {
          "id": "s04-02",
          "text": "and they are essential to practices in which a person is held responsible for his conduct and given credit for his achievements.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 4.675,
          "end": 11.931
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "02",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "02",
        "02"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s05": {
      "id": "s05",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s05.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-translation/v3-s05.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 9.742,
      "files": {
        "v3-s05.opus": "114ee6bb137fefb11ca59feeb548e1377c31bf36fd084c14618641fe87bdbd55",
        "v3-s05.mp3": "d51cda334103ae6ef12a2c85c67694048eedc02db35001a35d4d0357967c8506"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s05-01",
          "text": "Until these issues are resolved, a technology of behavior will continue to be rejected, ",
          "emotion": "warm",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.864
        },
        {
          "id": "s05-02",
          "text": "and with it possibly the only way to solve our problems.",
          "emotion": "warm",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 5.864,
          "end": 9.742
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "02",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "02",
        "02"
      ],
      "emotion": "warm",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    }
